#: processes/content/review-task.bpmn:71
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Prose, code nodes, or both. This is the only decision the generic lane makes on its own: everything after it is made inside a subprocess by the role that lane binds. Binds `content-review`, the same skill as Task_Consolidate in this lane, because a paper skill belongs to the science layer, which this harness diagram cannot reach. A paper process that wants semantic scoping adds it by calling this process."
